<h2>1. Executive Summary & Objective</h2>
<p>The <strong>Weather Information Dashboard</strong> is a responsive web application built using HTML5, Vanilla CSS3, and modern JavaScript (ES6+). It enables users to search for any global city or use browser GPS geolocation to view accurate, real-time meteorological conditions and extended multi-day forecasts.</p>
<p>The application integrates the public, free <strong>Open-Meteo Geocoding and Forecast REST APIs</strong> without requiring paid subscription keys or server-side intermediaries.</p>

