<h2>3. Weekly Implementation Milestones (Workspace Sheet)</h2>
<h3>Week 1: UI Development & API Integration</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Setup semantic HTML5 markup and clean file structure (index.html, style.css, app.js).</li>
  <li>Implemented glassmorphic CSS design system with custom properties and responsive grids.</li>
  <li>Built city search bar with debounced autocomplete querying Open-Meteo Geocoding.</li>
  <li>Integrated Open-Meteo REST API and handled asynchronous fetch promises.</li>
  <li>Mapped WMO weather codes to dynamic condition descriptions and vector SVG icons.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Week 2: Features, Testing & Finalization</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Added custom shimmering skeleton loaders for smooth loading states.</li>
  <li>Implemented error handling for invalid cities, network disconnection, and geolocation denial.</li>
  <li>Added 5-day daily forecast cards and 24-hour horizontal hourly slider.</li>
  <li>Connected HTML5 Geolocation API with BigDataCloud reverse geocoding for "My Location".</li>
  <li>Added Dark/Light mode theme switch with localStorage persistence.</li>
  <li>Implemented recent searches history and Metric/Imperial (°C/°F) unit conversion.</li>
  <li>Cleaned all source code comments and finalized project documentation.</li>
</ul>

